t & Dec OBE's - I provided the Voice of God Voice elements for the Takeaway Tour Aug - Sept 2014\",\"uploadDate\":\"2016-08-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Saturday Night Takeaway Voice of God"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>My most exciting voice over gig. The Saturday Night Takeaway Tour Voice of God. Front row tickets in Leeds thrown in too.</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/judgment-apocalypse-survival-voice","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Judgment Apocalypse Survival","aria-label":"Previous: Judgment Apocalypse Survival","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/pig-goes-pop-voiceover","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Pig goes Pop Voiceover","aria-label":"Next: Pig goes Pop Voiceover","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Voice of God Announcer</h2>\r\n<p>Every week I'm asked to provide my voice for events, shows or award ceremonies. Whilst the work steps up towards the end of the year, through the rest of the 12 months there is always something to voice or be a part of.<br>The <a href=\"/voice-of-god\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Voice of God Voiceover\">Voice of God</a> is the name for that big, booming announcer's voice you hear at large events and it's something I've provided for numerous events such as the Pure Beauty Awards and The Voice of God for Butlins shows and announcements for the last 8 years.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/W99pMUr6G8Q","title":"Saturday Night Takeaway Voice of God","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/saturday-night-takeaway-voice.jpg","alt":"Saturday night takeaway voice of God","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br>\r\n<h2>Cost effective voice over</h2>\r\n<p>It was great fun providing the voiceover for Saturday Night Takeaway's live show, which I recorded ahead of time. <br>I'm more than happy to provide LIVE voice-of-god services, however, pre-recording can save you money.<br>\r\nWith a full <a href=\"/voiceover-studio\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Guy's Studio\">professional studio</a> and high-quality recording equipment, let me record the audio and send as a WAV or mp3.<br>\r\nEven if the event line up changes at the last minute, it's not a problem to record new lines ahead of the event.\r\n</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>How can I get a Voice of God?</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for a voice of God? Or perhaps you need something softer and more natural for a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a> or <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>.  Please get in touch. I'd be very happy to send a short sample of your script before you book me. Just send a few lines of the script first so you can be sure I'm right for your event. 99% of the jobs delivered the same day.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Saturday Night Takeaway Voice of God","pageUrl":"saturday-night-takeaway-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","613",{"href":"/shooting-business-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/shooting-business-voice-over.jpg","alt":"Shooting Business Voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Shooting Business Voice"}]]}],["$","$L3","844",{"href":"/4-music-id-mobile-sponsor-bumpers-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/4-music-id-mobile-sponsor-bumpers-voice.jpg","alt":"4-music-id-mobile-sponsor-bumpers-voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"4 Music — ID Mobile Sponsor"}]]}],["$","$L3","985",{"href":"/beccas-bunce-voice-of-ringo","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/beccas-bunce-voice-of-ringo.jpg","alt":"Becca’s Bunch Voiceover – Ringo the Turtle Character","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Becca’s Bunch Voiceover – Ringo the Turtle"}]]}]]}]}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","$6","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound"